  type_choices_err_bare_unit.pcpp - break step of type_choices.pcpp:
  an imported unit's value too, written with its module (SM0015)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_choices_err_bare_unit.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_choices_err_bare_unit.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
